The program of omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m,
compiled by the driver for the machine's GPU and run there: each
reduction's variable is mapped tofrom, the teams and their threads
combine their partial results with it, and the program prints what the
sequential program prints.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -fopenmp -fdo-loops --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m -o %t
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY LIBOMPTARGET_INFO=17 %t 2> %t.info \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: FileCheck %s < %t.info
RUN: merkc -O2 -fopenmp -fdo-loops --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m -o %t.O2
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY LIBOMPTARGET_INFO=17 %t.O2 2> %t.O2.info \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: FileCheck %s < %t.O2.info
CHECK: info: Entering OpenMP kernel at {{.*}}omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m:{{[0-9]+}}:5 with 4 arguments:
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(region_slot)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(N)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(Step)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: tofrom(Sum)[8]
CHECK: info: Launching kernel {{.*}}pi_2_0{{.*}} in SPMD mode
In normalize, the first loop reads !A and gives Sum, which the second
reads as it updates !A.
CHECK: info: Entering OpenMP kernel at {{.*}}omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m:{{[0-9]+}}:5 with 4 arguments:
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(region_slot)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(N)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(STATE_VARIABLE_A_0)[8200]
CHECK-NEXT: info: tofrom(Sum)[8]
CHECK: info: Entering OpenMP kernel at {{.*}}omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m:{{[0-9]+}}:5 with 4 arguments:
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(region_slot)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(N)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: tofrom(STATE_VARIABLE_A_0)[8200]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(Sum)[8]
CHECK: info: Entering OpenMP kernel at {{.*}}omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do-reduction.m:{{[0-9]+}}:5 with 4 arguments:
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(region_slot)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(N)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: tofrom(Lo)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: tofrom(Hi)[8]
CHECK: info: Launching kernel {{.*}}range_3_0{{.*}} in SPMD mode
CHECK-NOT: Entering OpenMP kernel
